or submission 331 317 Acceptance rate of at least one prior submission papers 24.4% 22.4%       \\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s205\",\"d1\",52966,53352,\" 5  Survey Results  5.a Survey Rationale and Process  As for ICSE 2018, we sent out two surveys once final decisions had been made: (1) a survey to all submitting authors (including for rejected papers), sent out on February 27; (2) a survey to the PB/PC, sent out on March 14. The timing of the surveys was chosen as follows. Full results of these surveys can be found in Appendix D.  \",\"document\",[]],[\"s206\",\"d1\",53352,53680,\"For the author survey, by distributing after the author notification date, we can control for “happy” and “unhappy” authors and get separate data for each group. Hence, we sent out the survey after notifications. By waiting a few weeks after the notification, authors have “cooled” down and had time to think about the reviews. \",\"document\",[]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"ICSE duplicate submission statement\",\"time_scope\":\"agreement\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"web-f2480c9be1232e0ef2ee3058\",\"time_metadata\":{}}},\"source_span_columns\":[\"id\",\"doc_id\",\"start\",\"end\",\"text\",\"source_role\",\"source_message_indices\"]}"}], "logical_call_index": 23, "response_format": "plain", "input_tokens_local": 11601, "output_token_reserve": 4096, "input_margin": 256, "max_model_len": 120000, "tokenization_request_sha256": "faca031357438324b29e5ed0332604f25aa477bf8cb282fbbe85fde9dfbdb063", "tokenization_endpoint_sha256": "0ed12ee94b55bfdbc62fb247243af2d71aa1d7ea503f5f191605ae295c5ad94a", "token_count_is_estimate": false, "token_estimator_id": "deployment_vllm_chat_v1", "tokenizer_id": null, "add_generation_prompt": true, "tokenization_scope": "adapted_plain_text_chat_default_server_template", "token_accounting_note": "Deployment input count; model weights and tokenizer hash are not independently ver